        "original_id": "9d31fc85-eb69-5d63-84ef-3978d892a1b5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Candace Flynn, Ashley Tisdale, Sara Poulsen, Dan Povenmire, Brenda Song\n- Works: Phineas and Ferb, The Suite Life of Zack & Cody, The Suite Life on Deck\n- Roles: Maddie Fitzpatrick, London Tipton\n\nFacts:\n- Dan Povenmire created and designed Candace Gertrude Flynn as a main character in the Disney Channel animated television series Phineas and Ferb.\n- Ashley Tisdale voiced Candace Flynn in Phineas and Ferb.\n- Ashley Tisdale achieved mainstream success by playing Maddie Fitzpatrick in the Disney Channel series The Suite Life of Zack & Cody.\n- Sara Poulsen is best known for voicing Candace Flynn in Phineas and Ferb.\n- Sara Poulsen also dubbed Brenda Song's character London Tipton in The Suite Life of Zack & Cody and The Suite Life on Deck.",
